FILE /usr/share/man/cat1/stack-wrap.1
    stack-wrap IN -o OUT: rewrites a linked program so that it recurses deeper
    than one browser stack. Each function that makes calls charges its frame
    on entry; with too little room left it continues on a fresh stack.
    
    The program then records stack@0: an image that holds it declares
